      "comment": "IF EVER (7) ran eighth in a Other last time, copping a check in the run and finishing 6 lengths from the winner over 461m at Hobart. Has recorded a win from Box 7. Given another chance. BLUE ART (1) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (31.05) at Q Lakeside. Solid record here at this trip including 14 wins. Can measure up this time. NANGAR WALLY (6) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 25.28 beating Razor Hayze. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Capable of going well again. ZIPPING FRITZ (2) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
